<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens vs dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens vs dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened against both the dollar and the pound on Wednesday, commercial dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee eased against the dollar to a mean commercial rate of 20.0965 from 20.0905 on Tuesday. The rupee traded at a mean of 33.6325 versus the pound from 33.5830 on Tuesday.</p>
